//- The board's view menu, in the FIRST top header bar.
//-
//- It was a button in the board's second header bar. A view menu says what you
//- are looking AT, so it belongs beside the page's name in the one bar that is
//- always on screen - the same place the All Boards Lists/Table menu is.
//-
//- `unless currentBoard.isTemplatesBoard`: there is nothing to look at six
//- ways on a templates board. docs/Features/Page/Header.md
//- Whether THIS board is starred, and the button that changes it. Its own
//- template because the first header bar places it beside the starred-boards
//- dropdown rather than among the board's other controls: the two are one pair -
//- how many boards you have starred, and whether this is one of them.
//-
//- The outline star means not starred and the solid one means starred, so the
//- button shows its state rather than the action - the tooltip says the action.
//- docs/Features/Page/Header.md
template(name="boardStarButton")
  if currentBoard
    a.board-header-btn.js-star-board(class="{{#if isStarred}}is-active{{/if}}"
      title="{{#if isStarred}}{{_ 'click-to-unstar'}}{{else}}{{_ 'click-to-star'}}{{/if}}")
      i.fa(class="fa-star{{#unless isStarred}}-o{{/unless}}")
      if showStarCounter
        span.board-star-counter {{currentBoard.stars}}

template(name="boardViewMenu")
  unless currentBoard.isTemplatesBoard
    //- The name is VISIBLE beside the icon, not only in the tooltip. Six view
      icons are six glyphs to learn, and a tooltip is the one place a name
      cannot be read without hovering - so the button says which view is on.
      The bar wraps to a second row when it runs out of width, which is what
      makes a word beside the icon affordable. docs/Features/Page/Header.md
    a.board-header-btn.js-toggle-board-view(title="{{boardViewName}}")
      i.fa.fa-caret-down
      if $eq boardView 'board-view-swimlanes'
        i.fa.fa-th-large
      if $eq boardView 'board-view-lists'
        i.fa.fa-trello
      if $eq boardView 'board-view-cal'
        i.fa.fa-calendar
      if $eq boardView 'board-view-gantt'
        i.fa.fa-bar-chart
      if $eq boardView 'board-view-table'
        i.fa.fa-table
      if $eq boardView 'board-view-stats'
        i.fa.fa-pie-chart
      span.board-header-btn-label= boardViewName
